<section id="top">
        <div class="detail-shell">
            <a class="detail-back" href="/pages/projects.html">← Back to case studies</a>
            <span class="detail-kicker">Case Study</span>
            <div class="case-study-brand">
                <img src="/assets/logos/bosonic-logo-text.svg" alt="Bosonic" class="case-study-brand-logo">
            </div>
            <h1 class="detail-title">Bosonic PO workflow platform</h1>
            <p class="detail-subtitle">Purchase orders, approvals, branded PDFs, and document control for Bosonic</p>

            <div class="detail-meta">
                <span class="detail-chip"><span class="detail-chip-label">Date</span> Feb 2026</span>
                <span class="detail-chip"><span class="detail-chip-label">Build time</span> 36 hours</span>
                <span class="detail-chip detail-chip-accent"><span class="detail-chip-label">Outcome</span> End-to-end PO workflow</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-body">
                <p>quickler built a custom purchase order platform for Bosonic, with guided form entry, saved vendors and addresses, and line-item memory for faster repeat orders.</p>
                <p>Approval routing by email, approver signature handling, branded PDF generation, and status tracking were added so the workflow could move from pending to approved or denied without disappearing into inboxes.</p>
                <p>Paperless indexing links, history cloning, and setup automation were also integrated so new environments could start quickly with minimal manual steps.</p>
                <p class="detail-note">Live demo: <a href="https://demo.lochross.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">demo.lochross.com</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div>
                <p class="section-label">What It Included</p>
                <h2>Bosonic is now the named proof point for the invoice and PO workflow.</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="invoice-showcase-grid">
            <article class="invoice-showcase-card">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Approval email</span>
                <h3 class="invoice-showcase-title">The approver gets a clear decision email</h3>
                <p class="invoice-showcase-copy">Instead of a vague forwarding chain, the approver gets a proper summary with the key details and one obvious next action.</p>

                <div class="approval-email-preview" aria-label="Example Bosonic purchase order approval email">
                    <div class="approval-email-header">
                        <span class="approval-email-brand">Bosonic</span>
                        <span class="approval-email-status">Pending</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Approval needed</h4>
                    <p class="approval-email-subtitle">Hi Jack, please review PO-BOS-004.</p>
                    <div class="approval-email-summary">
                        <div><strong>Vendor:</strong> North Star Lab Supplies Ltd</div>
                        <div><strong>Bill to:</strong> Bosonic Ltd</div>
                        <div><strong>Ship to:</strong> Bosonic Inc, Newark</div>
                        <div><strong>Requested by:</strong> Samuel Snowden</div>
                        <div><strong>Total:</strong> £1,248.00</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approval-email-items">
                        <div class="approval-email-items-head">
                            <span>Items</span>
                            <span>Qty</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="approval-email-item">
                            <span>Precision lab assembly kits</span>
                            <span>4</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="approval-email-item">
                            <span>Instrument mounting fixtures</span>
                            <span>2</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approval-email-actions">
                        <span class="approval-email-button">Decide now</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="approval-email-footnote">Illustrative Bosonic-flavoured demo content shown for proof of workflow shape.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="invoice-showcase-card">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Approval chain</span>
                <h3 class="invoice-showcase-title">Named approvers, status, and clear document actions</h3>
                <p class="invoice-showcase-copy">This is the operational shape quickler built into the Bosonic workflow: obvious ownership, proper status, generated PDFs, and a filing path people can trust.</p>

                <div class="approval-demo">
                    <div class="approval-demo-header">
                        <div>
                            <strong>PO-BOS-004</strong>
                            <span>North Star Lab Supplies Ltd</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="approval-demo-pill approval-demo-pill-approved">Approved</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approval-demo-row">
                        <span class="approval-demo-label">Requested by</span>
                        <span class="approval-demo-value">Samuel Snowden</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approval-demo-row">
                        <span class="approval-demo-label">Approver</span>
                        <span class="approval-demo-value">Jack Shannon</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approval-demo-row">
                        <span class="approval-demo-label">Total</span>
                        <span class="approval-demo-value">£1,248.00</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approval-demo-actions">
                        <span class="approval-demo-action approval-demo-action-primary">PDF</span>
                        <span class="approval-demo-action">Paperless</span>
                        <span class="approval-demo-action">Clone</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="invoice-showcase-card">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Document output</span>
                <h3 class="invoice-showcase-title">A finished PO PDF with Bosonic branding</h3>
                <p class="invoice-showcase-copy">The output matters as much as the workflow. The system produces a clean finished document once the order has been checked and approved.</p>
                <figure class="invoice-preview-figure">
                    <img src="/assets/photos/invoices/po-document-preview.svg" alt="Preview of a finished purchase order PDF produced by the Bosonic workflow">
                </figure>
                <div class="invoice-preview-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/assets/docs/quickler-demo-po-shire.pdf" download>Download example PDF</a>
                    <span class="invoice-preview-note">Document preview shown as workflow proof.</span>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
        <div class="cta-content">
            <h2>Need faster reporting?</h2>
            <p>Get in touch if your team has one repeated report or document workflow that should be much closer to done before the day is over.</p>
            <a href="/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section" class="btn btn-primary">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </section>
